positions.description:
•	Develop tools using a wide array of technologies, including C# (.NET) and NT batch files to aid or replace various aspects of day-to-day reporting, monitoring, and administration;
•	Developed an multi-component secure, client-server file transfer solution for an automated client-server environment        
•	Monitor 175+ applications on 300+ remote automated systems;
•	Provide 24x7 troubleshooting and break-fix support for all monitored applications;
•	Administer and configure workstations to automate the monitoring process;        
•	Administer web-based documentation;
•	Redesign systems to meet the needs of new security protocols and modern technology, including:
		Database redesign; Client-Server SSH; Special encryption techniques; Coherent administration presentation

